        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/{size}/1851_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-04-28T04:58:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Evandan got it, as did NDRWnerd in the original post:</p>\n<p>“Does he somehow need to feed off a humans life-force when he transforms, and if he doesn’t have the victim he burns some of his own life-force?”</p>\n<p>Note that he heals whenever he hits a hero.  Same thing for killing victims.  When he transforms into his Monstrosity form, he needs as much life force as he can get, and any victims left unkilled hurt him.</p>",
